  "details": "Reproduction steps:\n\n1. Create 2 gameobjects. Hierarchical relationship does not matter.\n\n2. Create a constraint (rotation, for example), and assign the the first object as a source for the second\n\n3. Lock the inspector to show the object with the constraint. The sources menu does not have to be expanded\n\n4. Delete the tracked object from scene view\n\n5. Unity crashes\n\nReproduction video attached",
